{
  "_doc": "Build-your-own templates for the next-meal optimizer (SPEC 10). Courses are substrings of NetNutrition course names (2026-11-07 scrape). price_item = the receipt item name whose price applies (from `prices`, i.e. William's receipts); if priced_by_protein, the variant = protein name (or an item alias of it), else any price for price_item. include = always part of the item (tortilla, arepa, biscuit). slots: pick min..max items from a course (minus `exclude`: Sazon lists the arepa under toppings too); portions use `format`'s keyword. fixed = components exactly as ordered on receipts.",
